  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\"> 修读本科课程证书项目相关同学：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">   本年度</font><font face=\"宋体\">“本科课程修读证书项目”证书申请即将开始，目前全校已开设项目</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">21</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">个，其中</font><font face=\"宋体\">1</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">个项目可申请证书。请完成项目修读要求的同学按照附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">2中各项目规定时间，向项目开设院系提交证书申请。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">   现就各项目证书申请安排统一通知如下：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\"> </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">一、申请材料：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  1、请填写</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">《</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">课程证书项目证书申请表》并签字</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">，</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">表格详见附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">1。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  2、注册中心出具的成绩单1份原件，（邮件申请需提交电子版成绩单）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  3、根据项目要求，提供2寸的免冠彩色蓝底照片（毕业照、证件照均可）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  4、有特殊要求的项目请根据项目要求</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">提交材料</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\"> </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">二、提交要求：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  1、申请材料根据《各项目证书申请安排》（详见附件2）中各项目提供的地址或邮箱进行提交，电子版申请材料请打包发送。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  2、请使用清华邮箱提交申请材料。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">  3、邮件命名： ***项目修读证书申请； 文件命名：项目名称+学号+姓名+院系。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\"> </font></span></span></span></span></span></span>  <span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">请完成项目修读要求、准备申请证书的同学在各项目规定时间内提交申请材料，详情请咨询各项目联系老师。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">         教务处联系电话：62780760   </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">         联系人：刘俊霞</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">                </font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">              <font face=\"宋体\">教务处</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:7px; margin-bottom:7px; text-indent:199.5000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">       202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font><font face=\"宋体\">6月1</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "修读本科课程证书项目相关同学： 本年度 “本科课程修读证书项目”证书申请即将开始，目前全校已开设项目 21 个，其中 1 6 个项目可申请证书。请完成项目修读要求的同学按照附件 2中各项目规定时间，向项目开设院系提交证书申请。 现就各项目证书申请安排统一通知如下： 一、申请材料： 1、请填写 《 课程证书项目证书申请表》并签字 ， 表格详见附件 1。 2、注册中心出具的成绩单1份原件，（邮件申请需提交电子版成绩单）。 3、根据项目要求，提供2寸的免冠彩色蓝底照片（毕业照、证件照均可）。 4、有特殊要求的项目请根据项目要求 提交材料 。 二、提交要求： 1、申请材料根据《各项目证书申请安排》（详见附件2）中各项目提供的地址或邮箱进行提交，电子版申请材料请打包发送。 2、请使用清华邮箱提交申请材料。 3、邮件命名： ***项目修读证书申请； 文件命名：项目名称+学号+姓名+院系。 请完成项目修读要求、准备申请证书的同学在各项目规定时间内提交申请材料，详情请咨询各项目联系老师。 教务处联系电话：62780760 联系人：刘俊霞 教务处 202 6 年 6月1 6 日",
